{
  "sn14.33:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 14.33 ",
  "sn14.33:0.2": "4. Catutthavagga ",
  "sn14.33:0.3": "Nocedaṁsutta ",
  "sn14.33:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn14.33:1.2": "“No cedaṁ, bhikkhave, pathavīdhātuyā assādo abhavissa, nayidaṁ sattā pathavīdhātuyā sārajjeyyuṁ. ",
  "sn14.33:1.3": "Yasmā ca kho, bhikkhave, atthi pathavīdhātuyā assādo, tasmā sattā pathavīdhātuyā sārajjanti. ",
  "sn14.33:1.4": "No cedaṁ, bhikkhave, pathavīdhātuyā ādīnavo abhavissa, nayidaṁ sattā pathavīdhātuyā nibbindeyyuṁ. ",
  "sn14.33:1.5": "Yasmā ca kho, bhikkhave, atthi pathavīdhātuyā ādīnavo, tasmā sattā pathavīdhātuyā nibbindanti. ",
  "sn14.33:1.6": "No cedaṁ, bhikkhave, pathavīdhātuyā nissaraṇaṁ abhavissa, nayidaṁ sattā pathavīdhātuyā nissareyyuṁ. ",
  "sn14.33:1.7": "Yasmā ca kho, bhikkhave, atthi pathavīdhātuyā nissaraṇaṁ, tasmā sattā pathavīdhātuyā nissaranti. ",
  "sn14.33:2.1": "No cedaṁ, bhikkhave, āpodhātuyā assādo abhavissa …pe… ",
  "sn14.33:2.2": "no cedaṁ, bhikkhave, tejodhātuyā …pe… ",
  "sn14.33:2.3": "no cedaṁ, bhikkhave, vāyodhātuyā assādo abhavissa, nayidaṁ sattā vāyodhātuyā sārajjeyyuṁ. ",
  "sn14.33:2.4": "Yasmā ca kho, bhikkhave, atthi vāyodhātuyā assādo, tasmā sattā vāyodhātuyā sārajjanti. ",
  "sn14.33:2.5": "No cedaṁ, bhikkhave, vāyodhātuyā ādīnavo abhavissa, nayidaṁ sattā vāyodhātuyā nibbindeyyuṁ. ",
  "sn14.33:2.6": "Yasmā ca kho, bhikkhave, atthi vā